<!-- SUBJECT OPTIONS (under 50 characters, set in Brevo):
     1. O nosso novo site já está online
     2. Temos site novo. Venha conhecer
     3. Matize Atelier: novo site online

     PREHEADER OPTIONS (A is in mj-preview below):
     A. Os nossos serviços e referências, agora num novo site.
     B. Fica o convite para nos visitar em matizeatelier.pt.

     IMAGES (files in ./images/): served from matizeatelier.pt/email/ via the
     "mail-templates" SFTP context. Sync before previewing or sending.
     Layout B: hero 560x380 (file 1120x760), four service tiles 272x272 (files 560x560). -->
<mjml lang="pt-PT">
	<mj-head>
		<mj-title>O nosso novo site já está online</mj-title>
		<mj-preview>Os nossos serviços e referências, agora num novo site.</mj-preview>
		<mj-include path="../../_partials/_head.mjml" />
	</mj-head>

	<mj-body>

		<mj-include path="../../_partials/_header.mjml" />

		<!-- Hero photo + coral panel, one rounded card -->
		<mj-wrapper padding="0" css-class="mtz-card">

			<mj-section background-color="#EC6F63" padding="0">
				<mj-column>
					<mj-image
						src="https://matizeatelier.pt/email/brevo/announcement-2026-11/images/mtz-launch-hero.jpg"
						alt="Aparador com candeeiro, vasos e quadros sobre parede cor de salmão"
						href="https://matizeatelier.pt?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch"
						width="560px"
						padding="0"
					/>
				</mj-column>
			</mj-section>

			<mj-section background-color="#EC6F63" padding="40px 32px 36px">
				<mj-column>
					<!-- Pill label. Caps have no descenders, so top padding is 2px more to centre them;
					     right padding is 2px less to offset the trailing letter-spacing.
					     Outlook desktop drops the radius and padding: a plain beige box. -->
					<mj-text font-size="11px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="0.18em" line-height="1.4" text-transform="uppercase" padding="0 0 18px"><span style="display:inline-block; background-color:#E1D7BE; border-radius:999px; line-height:1; padding:8px 12px 6px 14px;">Novo site</span></mj-text>
					<mj-text font-family="Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif" font-size="38px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="0.06em" line-height="1.12" text-transform="uppercase" padding="0 0 24px">Já está<br />online.</mj-text>
					<!-- Brevo merge tag; contacts without a first name get "Olá!" -->
					<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.7" padding="0 0 12px">Olá{% if contact.FIRSTNAME %} {{ contact.FIRSTNAME }}{% endif %}!</mj-text>
					<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.7" padding="0 0 12px"><strong>Para nós, cada espaço conta uma história.</strong> Por isso começamos sempre por ouvir quem vai viver nele, e acompanhamos cada projecto do conceito à execução, com atenção ao detalhe.</mj-text>
					<mj-text font-size="15px" line-height="1.7" padding="0 0 28px">No novo site encontra os nossos serviços e as referências que inspiram o nosso trabalho.</mj-text>
					<mj-button
						href="https://matizeatelier.pt?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch"
						align="left"
						background-color="#0A0907"
						color="#E1D7BE"
						font-size="14px"
						font-weight="bold"
						letter-spacing="0.14em"
						text-transform="uppercase"
						border-radius="6px"
						inner-padding="18px 28px"
						padding="0"
					>Visitar o site</mj-button>
				</mj-column>
			</mj-section>

		</mj-wrapper>

		<!-- Services 2x2. Each tile links to its section on /servicos/. mj-group keeps
		     two tiles per row on phones. Corners match the card (10px). -->
		<mj-wrapper padding="0" css-class="mtz-card">

			<mj-section padding="36px 0 12px">
				<mj-column>
					<mj-text font-size="11px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="0.2em" line-height="1.4" text-transform="uppercase" padding="0">Os nossos serviços</mj-text>
				</mj-column>
			</mj-section>

			<mj-section padding="0">
				<mj-group>
					<mj-column padding="0 8px 16px 0">
						<mj-image
							src="https://matizeatelier.pt/email/brevo/announcement-2026-11/images/mtz-launch-servico-design-interiores.jpg"
							alt="Design de Interiores"
							href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#design-de-interiores"
							border-radius="10px"
							padding="0"
						/>
						<mj-text font-size="10px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="0.12em" line-height="1.5" text-transform="uppercase" padding="12px 0 0">
							<a href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#design-de-interiores" style="color:#0A0907; text-decoration:none;">Design de Interiores &rarr;</a>
						</mj-text>
					</mj-column>
					<mj-column padding="0 0 16px 8px">
						<mj-image
							src="https://matizeatelier.pt/email/brevo/announcement-2026-11/images/mtz-launch-servico-consultoria.jpg"
							alt="Consultoria e Aconselhamento"
							href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#consultoria-e-aconselhamento"
							border-radius="10px"
							padding="0"
						/>
						<mj-text font-size="10px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="0.12em" line-height="1.5" text-transform="uppercase" padding="12px 0 0">
							<a href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#consultoria-e-aconselhamento" style="color:#0A0907; text-decoration:none;">Consultoria e Aconselhamento &rarr;</a>
						</mj-text>
					</mj-column>
				</mj-group>
			</mj-section>

			<mj-section padding="0">
				<mj-group>
					<mj-column padding="0 8px 0 0">
						<mj-image
							src="https://matizeatelier.pt/email/brevo/announcement-2026-11/images/mtz-launch-servico-decoracao-styling.jpg"
							alt="Decoração e Styling"
							href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#decoracao-e-styling"
							border-radius="10px"
							padding="0"
						/>
						<mj-text font-size="10px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="0.12em" line-height="1.5" text-transform="uppercase" padding="12px 0 0">
							<a href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#decoracao-e-styling" style="color:#0A0907; text-decoration:none;">Decoração e Styling &rarr;</a>
						</mj-text>
					</mj-column>
					<mj-column padding="0 0 0 8px">
						<mj-image
							src="https://matizeatelier.pt/email/brevo/announcement-2026-11/images/mtz-launch-servico-gestao-obra.jpg"
							alt="Gestão e Acompanhamento de Obra"
							href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#gestao-e-acompanhamento-de-obra"
							border-radius="10px"
							padding="0"
						/>
						<mj-text font-size="10px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="0.12em" line-height="1.5" text-transform="uppercase" padding="12px 0 0">
							<a href="https://matizeatelier.pt/servicos/?utm_source=brevo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=site-launch#gestao-e-acompanhamento-de-obra" style="color:#0A0907; text-decoration:none;">Gestão e Acompanhamento de Obra &rarr;</a>
						</mj-text>
					</mj-column>
				</mj-group>
			</mj-section>

		</mj-wrapper>

		<!-- Gap between the body cards and the footer -->
		<mj-section padding="20px 0 0">
			<mj-column></mj-column>
		</mj-section>

		<mj-include path="../../_partials/_footer-pt.mjml" />

	</mj-body>
</mjml>
